---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Service - NumanX Tools" description="Read the Terms of Service for NumanX Tools. Understand the guidelines and conditions for using our free platform." keywords="terms of service, tos, guidelines, user agreement, numanx tools" canonical="https://toolshub.numanxstudio.com/terms-of-service/">
  <main class="min-h-screen pt-16 pb-24 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Hero -->
      <section class="text-center mb-16">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-700/50 bg-zinc-900/80 text-tertiary text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-8"
        >
          <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
            <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-amber-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-amber-500"></span>
          </span>
          Legal
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight leading-none">
          Terms of
          <span
            class="block mt-2 text-amber-400"
          >
            Service
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-tertiary text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Simple, transparent rules for using NumanX Tools.
          <span class="text-secondary"> Last updated: 6 November 2026.</span>
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Terms Content -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >1</span
            >
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            By accessing or using NumanX Tools ("the Platform"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you
            do not agree with any part of these terms, you must not use the Platform. Continued use of the Platform
            constitutes acceptance of any updates to these terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >2</span
            >
            2. Use of Services
          </h2>
          <p class="text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            NumanX Tools is operated by Muhammad Numan Usmani (NumanX Studio) and provides free, browser-based
            utilities for image processing, text analysis, calculations, and more. Files and text you use in the tools
            are processed in your browser and are not uploaded to our servers; see our
            <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 underline">Privacy Policy</a> for
            details, including the contact and feedback forms. You may use the tools for personal, educational, or
            commercial purposes as long as you comply with these terms. You must be at least 13 years old to use the
            Platform.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >3</span
            >
            3. Acceptable Use
          </h2>
          <p class="text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            You agree not to misuse the Platform by attempting to disrupt its functionality, bypass security measures,
            send spam or automated submissions through our forms, or use the tools for unlawful purposes. You must have
            the right to use any file or content you process, and you must not use the tools, including the AI tools, to
            create content that is illegal, infringes the rights of others, impersonates real people, or is intended to
            harass, defraud, or mislead. You are responsible for verifying the accuracy of any results produced by the
            tools, especially for critical calculations or decisions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >4</span
            >
            4. Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p class="text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            All tools, designs, code, and content on NumanX Tools are the intellectual property of NumanX unless
            otherwise stated. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or reverse-engineer the Platform's code without
            explicit permission. Open-source components used by the Platform remain under their own licenses. Output
            generated by the tools (e.g., converted images, QR codes) belongs to you, to the extent the law allows.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >5</span
            >
            5. AI Features and Results
          </h2>
          <p class="text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            Some tools use automated or AI-based methods to summarize, rewrite, check, or generate text, code, and
            images. These results can be incomplete, inaccurate, or unsuitable for your purpose. Do not rely on them as
            professional, legal, medical, financial, or academic advice, and review them before you use or publish
            them. You are responsible for how you use AI-generated output.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >6</span
            >
            6. Tool Availability
          </h2>
          <p class="text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            The tools are provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis. We strive to maintain high uptime and
            performance, but we do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation. Tools may be updated, modified,
            or discontinued at any time without prior notice. Results may vary depending on browser, device, and input
            data.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >7</span
            >
            7. Third-Party Links
