        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >10</span
            >
            10. Suspension and Termination
          </h2>
          <p class="text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            We may restrict or block access to the Platform, or to our forms, for anyone who breaks these terms or
            misuses the service. You may stop using the Platform at any time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/10 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold shrink-0"
              >11</span
