            12. Changes to Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated
            "Last updated" date. Continued use of the Platform after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the
            new terms. We encourage you to review this page periodically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-zinc-800/80 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
